					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Further ruminations for your consideration:</p> <p>&quot;SCP-1638-J is not dated and its country of origin is unknown.&quot; - &quot;SCP-1638-J is not dated, but it's not from around these parts.&quot;</p> <p>&quot;Last but not least, the novels alluded to by SCP-1638-J have not been located as of ██-██-████.&quot; - &quot;Last but not least, researchers haven't seen hide nor hair of the novels alluded to by SCP-1638-J as of ██-██-████.&quot;</p> <p>Up to you - I just thought I saw a way to cram a couple more cliches into this thing&#8230; :)</p> 
				 	]]>
