				<wikidot:authorName>Goodwill</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1124057</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Maybe this thing just isn't quite for me personally. My tastes aren't as refined as most others on this site, so take my opinion with a grain of salt. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">As for ideas, I'm not entirely sure what you were going for here. What's the gist of what you wanted to convey? I might not be able to help all that much, but perhaps we can get something going if I understand a little more.</span></p> <p>Edit: Then again, you are getting upvotes, and I'm not gonna be some douchebag who advocates for a rewrite if everyone else likes it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
