					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-459073#post-1410133</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-459073/scp-1638-j#post-1410133</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 05 Apr 2012 00:15:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Goodwill</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1124057</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So&#8230;the joke is that you start to use a lot of cliched idioms when you get near it? That's not very funny, and I fail to see the relevance of the novel advertisements. I would make the details a little more congruent and develop the idea more, and make it a regular SCP.</p> <p>I will say that the writing is decent. It's the idea itself that needs work.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
